    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt.\n\nThe text prompt asks for: \"生成一段15秒、9:16竖屏的三维动画环境声同步短片，采用三维动画风格\" (Generate a 15-second, 9:16 vertical dimensional animation environment sound synchronization short film in three-dimensional animation style).\n\nLooking at the frames:\n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\n- The frames depict a woman in a gray sweater and black pants standing by a window.\n- The resolution is solid with clear details; lighting is warm indoor with a rainy outdoor view.\n- Rain droplets on the glass and the window frame are well-rendered; textures on clothing and surroundings are convincing.\n- Overall image quality is strong, with good clarity and stable rendering across frames.\n- There are no obvious artifacts or distortions; color grading remains consistent.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\n- The prompt specifies a 15-second, 9:16 vertical dimensional animation environment sound synchronization short film in three-dimensional animation style.\n- The video presents a clearly three-dimensional rendered scene with a female subject, indoor setting, rain visible through a window, and a coherent environment.\n- The composition adheres to the requested vertical format and the sequence progresses logically from setup to the character’s interaction with the window.\n- The alignment with the prompt is strong overall, capturing the essential elements of the brief.\n\nPhysical/Common-sense Consistency Analysis:\n- The scene maintains plausible physics: rain behavior, indoor lighting, and the character’s movements are coherent with everyday expectations.\n- The character’s posture and hand interactions with the window appear natural, and spatial relationships remain consistent throughout.\n- No evident violations of physical plausibility are observed.\n\nOverall assessment:\n- Visual quality is strong with high fidelity and stable rendering.\n- Text-to-video alignment is solid, faithfully reflecting the core aspects of the brief.\n- Physical/common-sense consistency is robust, with believable interactions and environmental dynamics.\n\nGround-truth scores:\n- Visual Quality: 4\n- Text-to-Video Alignment: 4\n- Physical Consistency: 4\n\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 4\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 4\n"
